From: yuma shimizu <46545607+mouseos@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt8167-msdc-personality: IOKit personality of the MT8167 eMMC driver

MT8167 boards link the MSDC eMMC driver NativeMsdc (github.com/mouseos/NativeMsdc) into the kernel. It matches the
platform device of the msdc0 ADT node. The personality is part of every MT8167 kernel that takes this series; a board
without the driver archive only logs the missing class.

--- a/iokit/KernelConfigTables.cpp
+++ b/iokit/KernelConfigTables.cpp
@@ -56,6 +56,11 @@
     "     'IOProviderClass' = IOPlatformExpertDevice;"
     "     'IOProbeScore'    = 0:32;"
     "   },"
+    "   {"
+    "     'IOClass'         = NativeMsdc;"
+    "     'IOProviderClass' = IOPlatformDevice;"
+    "     'IOProbeScore'    = 1000:32;"
+    "   },"
     "   {"
     "     'IOClass'         = IOExclaveProxy;"
     "     'IOProviderClass' = IOService;"
